insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('76bdc002-11a3-5bde-8f22-0ff3b6cafe89', 'rg5-context-clues-p02', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g5-context-clues'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Chess Club Match$q$, $q$Mateo had played chess with his grandfather every Sunday for two years. Still, his first tournament made him feel anxious. His hands were sweaty, and his stomach felt full of butterflies.

His first opponent was a tall girl named Priya. She played quickly and confidently. Mateo, on the other hand, was cautious. He checked every move twice before he touched a piece.

Halfway through the game, Priya made a blunder. She left her queen where Mateo's knight could take it. Mateo almost shouted with surprise. He captured the queen and kept playing carefully.

Priya did not give up. She was persistent, fighting for every square until the very end. In the end, though, Mateo won.

Afterward, Priya shook his hand and smiled. "Good game," she said. "I rushed that one move. Next time I'll slow down like you."

Mateo grinned. His nerves had vanished. Now he only felt proud and ready for the next round.$q$, 'draft')
