   $q$What do the stage directions at the start of Scene 2 show readers?$q$, $q$[{"text":"That Lena has come back from getting labels","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reverses-sequence"},{"text":"That Milo has left and a new visitor has arrived","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"That Ravi has opened the glass case for Milo","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"That Milo has become interested in the snail fossil","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$That Milo has become interested in the snail fossil$q$, $q$The directions say Milo is "still at the table, holding a magnifying glass over the snail fossil," which shows he is now interested. Lena does not return until later in Scene 2.$q$, 'draft', 'a957234f-3589-5ba2-8f3f-13c29693df53')
